cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its findings, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "grammar-of-immunity"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and manuscript for a direct test of whether TCR CDR3-beta
  representations segmented along V(D)J recombination boundaries generalize to
  epitopes absent from training. They do not: on the official IMMREP23
  benchmark no method exceeds 0.52 Macro AUC0.1 on unseen peptides, and the
  within-distribution advantage is explained by germline V/J identity rather
  than junctional sequence. Pure Python standard library, deterministic under
  fixed seeds.
